{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772934994734,"story":{"title":"Hugo and the Howling Wind","userPrompt":"hurricane and dancing monkeys","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Hugo felt small. The wind howled! It shook his house. The sky was gray. Rain splashed the glass. A storm! He wished he had a friend.","illustrationPrompt":"Hugo, a small boy with big eyes, looks worriedly out a window. Rain streaks the glass. A gnarled tree bends in the wind outside. Colors: muted grays, blues, and a touch of yellow from a lamp inside. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772934214080,"durationMs":6458,"retries":0,"promptLength":775,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short light brown hair in messy, slightly windswept, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with small, sad, lonely, scared expression, wearing A slightly oversized yellow sweater, blue overalls with patches, and brown boots, freckles across his nose, a small gap between his two front teeth, slightly rosy cheeks, always slightly scuffed boots. Hugo sitting alone inside his house, looking out the window at the storm. The house should look cozy but the storm outside should look fierce. in Hugo's Cozy Home - Interior, near a window. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Suddenly, a thump! A small monkey clung to the porch. It was wet and scared. Hugo peeked out. \"Hello?\" he asked, soft and low.","illustrationPrompt":"Hugo cautiously opens the door. A small, shivering monkey clings to the porch railing. Rain is still falling. Colors: soft grays, greens, browns, with a pop of orange for the monkey's fur. Style: whimsical children's book 