. More monkeys dancing and singing outside in the wind. Hugo is inside, laughing and watching them. in Hugo's Cozy Home - Interior (looking out a window) and Exterior (yard). Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Hugo went out. The monkeys cheered! They pulled him in their dance. The wind swirled around them. It felt like a wild, fun game!","illustrationPrompt":"Hugo joins the monkeys in their dance. They hold hands and spin around. The wind blows their hair and clothes. Everyone is smiling and laughing. Colors: bright and cheerful, with swirling effects to show the wind. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772934219318,"durationMs":4920,"retries":0,"promptLength":912,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short light brown hair in messy, slightly windswept, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with excited, playful, carefree expression, wearing A slightly oversized yellow sweater, blue overalls with patches, and brown boots, freckles across his nose, a small gap between his two front teeth, slightly rosy cheeks, always slightly scuffed boots. A small varied shades of brown and beige fur monkey, big-expressive dark brown eyes with welcoming, joyful expression, various sizes and slight color differences, some have longer tails, some have slightly different face markings, average build. Hugo joining the monkeys in their dance in the wind. in Hugo's Cozy Home - Yard. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"The wind grew calm. The rain slowed down. The monkeys still danced. They made up silly songs. Hugo sang with them, loud and free!","illustrationPrompt":"The storm begins to subside. The sun peeks through the clouds. Hugo and 